{"3895710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mind Faux: The First Compliance", "steam_appid": 3895710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mind Faux: </i>The First Compliance is a single player first-person narrative puzzle game designed to challenge your critical thinking, media literacy, and understanding of propaganda. Set in a mysterious and immersive environment, you will solve puzzles and interact with symbolic elements, gradually uncovering your unwitting role in a mysterious plot, leaving you to wonder: Why are you being tasked with these puzzles? And who is watching you through the cameras?  <br> <br><br>Explore the 3D environment, listening and looking for clues to solve the mystery. You will see messages as you explore. Who are they from? You will hear a voice that guides you along and comments on your progress on the puzzles. They seem helpful, but their motives are not clear. As you try to figure out who to trust, you'll be left to wonder: Is this a Mind Friend or a Mind Faux?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><br><strong>Immersive Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our realistic graphics and minimal UI are designed for maximum immersion, allowing you to fully lose yourself in a mysterious world.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mind Faux: </i>The First Compliance is a single player first-person narrative puzzle game designed to challenge your critical thinking, media literacy, and understanding of propaganda. Set in a mysterious and immersive environment, you will solve puzzles and interact with symbolic elements, gradually uncovering your unwitting role in a mysterious plot, leaving you to wonder: Why are you being tasked with these puzzles? And who is watching you through the cameras?  <br> <br><br>Explore the 3D environment, listening and looki